<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia OYL year net up 52.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia OYL year net up 52.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 120.01   vs	  78.68</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 97.6    vs	  78.2</p>
<p>    Turnover		 2,929.10   vs     2,565.93</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   190.08   vs	 151.12</p>
<p>    Minorities	   less  3.17   vs  less   7.74</p>
<p>    Dividend   (percent)    25.0    vs	  25.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name is OYL Industries Bhd. It is a diversified firm involved in property letting, making air-conditioners and other activities.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
